  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "3c7217bb",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Reading and writing data\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "97371cdf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Displaying data on screen\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "081cbbbe",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The simplest way to display the value of a variable or a mathematical expression on the screen is to write the name of the variable or the expression **without a semicolon** after it."
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3841649e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Example. If the variable `x` is assigned the value `1`, then after executing the following line of code, the value of the variable `x` will be displayed on the screen:"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1e0ead63",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = 1"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "61b581ef",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "As the variable `x` has already been defined, simply writing the name of this variable will give you its value:\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3016067f",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8048c187",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "In exactly the same way, the results of mathematical operations are displayed on the screen:\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a5b51964",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "2 + 3"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6181b27f",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "2 > 1"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8b6d2a2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "If you place a **semicolon** after an expression, the display of that expression value will be suppressed:\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "92ed223f",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = 2;"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9ec9312b",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "4*5;"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1814ecfa",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "If a code cell contains several expressions, then after this cell has been executed, only the result of the **last expression** will be displayed on the screen. \n\nFor example, after executing the following cell, only the value of the variable `t` will be displayed:\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a9e516ad",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = 1\r\ny = 2\r\nz = 3; t = 4"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fe847d8c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "If you need to display data on the screen at any point within a code cell, you can do so using the following functions:\n\n* `print` – displays the values of variables, constants, mathematical or logical expressions on the screen. If you need to display multiple values (`x, y, z`), they are listed separated by commas: `print(x, y, z)`;\n* `println` – the same as `print`, but with a line break, i.e. the next output will appear on a new line;\n* `display` – the same as `print`, but this function can only take a single argument (a constant, a variable or an expression).\n* `show` – the same as `display`.\n\nBelow are a few examples of how to use the `print` function:\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "36e275ed",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "print(2*3+5)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
