    {
      "id": "63ced599",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️Task 1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "420a1624",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Set the value of the variable `x` to `5`. Then calculate the values of the variables `y` and `z` using the following formulas: $y=(2x+1)/7$ and $z=\\sin(y)$. After that, display the values of all three variables `x`, `y` and `z` on the screen using the `println` function.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6ce823fa",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "86b80902",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">Hint</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33164ec5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "To ensure that the meaning of each value is clear when printing the values of miltiple variables to the screen, we recommend calling the `println` function with two arguments: the first argument is a string constant containing the variable name followed by an equals sign, and the second argument is the variable itself. For example: `println(\"x = \", x)`.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9905eb57",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">Solution</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5479e52e",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = 5\r\ny = (2x + 1)/7\r\nz = sin(y)\r\nprintln(\"x = \", x)\r\nprintln(\"y = \", y)\r\nprintln(\"z = \", z)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
