    },
    {
      "id": "7c1bf30d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Input from the keyboard\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "79e3c3a7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "You can read input from the keyboard using the `readline()` function. Let’s consider two cases:\n\n1.   If you need to input a variable `x` of a string type, use the following command: \n\n```\nx = readline()\n```\n\n2. If you need to input a variable of a numeric type (integer, real or boolean), use the following syntax: \n\n```\nx = parse(Type, readline())\n``` \n\nThe `readline` function is designed to read only string-type data. To convert the input variable to a numeric data type, use the `parse` function. Its first argument, `Type`, specifies the type of the variable (`Int`, `Float64`, `Float32`, `Bool`, etc.) to which the string variable specified by the second argument of `readline()` should be converted.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4ce3d428",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️Task 3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d59d1ed2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Input the value of the string-type variable `x` from the keyboard. To do this, type the following command: \n```\nx = readline()\n```\n Below the cells containing your code, a field will appear for entering a value from the keyboard. Type the word `Hello` (without quotation marks!) into it and press Enter. The value you have entered for the variable `x` will be displayed on the screen.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "650c577e",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f8240a54",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">Solution</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0702df33",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```\r\nx = readline()\r\n\r\nstdin>  Hello\r\n\"Hello\"\r\n```\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9380d42f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️Task 4\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "478ad415",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Enter the value of the real variable `x`, equal to `1.5`, from the keyboard. To do this, type the following command:\n```\nx = parse(Float64, readline())\n```\nThis command will prompt you to enter the value of the variable `x` from the keyboard and convert it to a real number. Then, in the field that appears, enter the number `1.5` and press the Enter key.\n\nUse the following command to square the simple variable `x`.\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "49ddb34f",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0d2574e4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">Solution</span>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4970b569",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```\r\nx = parse(Float64, readline())\r\n\r\nstdin>  1.5\r\n1. 5\r\n\r\nx^2\r\n\r\n2. 25\r\n```\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section title",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
